:xunsong-body-138:p001:m0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"丘明","kind":"person","person_id":"99j_eyj_m1z","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-body-138:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit044:m0184","start":184,"end":186,"surface":"丘明","kind":"person","person_id":"99j_eyj_m1z","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"摯虞評論明左丘明為春秋作傳，與已有左丘明經學身份同；不是書名左傳本身的人錨。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit044","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit044:m0245","start":245,"end":248,"surface":"左丘明","kind":"person","person_id":"99j_eyj_m1z","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"摯虞評論明左丘明為春秋作傳，與已有左丘明經學身份同；不是書名左傳本身的人錨。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit044","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-034-duyu:p022","text":"預身不跨馬，射不穿劄，而每任大事，輒居將率之列。結交接物，恭而有禮，問無所隱，誨人不倦，敏於事而慎於言。既立功之後，從容無事，乃耽思經籍，為《春秋左氏經傳集解》。又參考眾家譜第，謂之《釋例》。又作《盟會圖》、《春秋長曆》，備成一家之學，比老乃成。又撰《女記贊》。當時論者謂預文義質直，世人未之重，唯秘書監摯虞賞之，曰：「左丘明本為《春秋》作傳，而《左傳》遂自孤行，《釋例》本為《傳》設，而所發明何但《左傳》，故亦孤行。」時王濟解相馬，又甚愛之，而和嶠頗聚斂，預常稱「濟有馬癖，嶠有錢癖」。武帝聞之，謂預曰：「卿有何癖？」對曰：「臣有《左傳》癖。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","source_position":{"raw_start":10392,"raw_end":10682,"raw_character_offsets":[10394,10395,10396,10397,10398,10399,10400,10401,10402,10403,10404,10405,10406,10407,10408,10409,10410,10411,10412,10413,10414,10415,10416,10417,10418,10419,10420,10421,10422,10423,10424,10425,10426,10427,10428,10429,10430,10431,10432,10433,10434,10435,10436,10437,10438,10439,10440,10441,10442,10443,10444,10445,10446,10447,10448,10449,10450,10451,10452,10453,10454,10455,10456,10457,10458,10459,10460,10461,10462,10463,10464,10470,10471,